{"id": "86337", "name": "אינטגרל מוכלל מ-(−∞) עד 0 – x·e^(nx) (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Evaluate the following improper integral if possible.</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int^0_{-\\infty} {{CT:0}} {{CT:1}} e^{{{CT:2}}{{CT:1}}} d{{CT:1}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:0.92em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0\">If the integral cannot be evaluated enter 99999 (5 9's).</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Find an antiderivative by parts, then evaluate it between the limits, the lower one as a limit.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — Integration by parts</b><br>To solve this integral use the formula for integration by parts, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( \\int u\\frac{dv}{dx}dx= uv-\\int v\\frac{du}{dx}dx\\)</span>.<br>Let<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[u = {{CT:0}}{{CT:1}} , \\frac{dv}{d{{CT:1}}} = e^{{{CT:2}}{{CT:1}}}\\]</p>Then<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\int{{CT:0}} {{CT:1}} e^{{{CT:2}}{{CT:1}}}d{{CT:1}} = \\frac{{{CT:0}}{{CT:1}}e^{{{CT:2}}{{CT:1}}}}{{CT:2}}-\\int \\frac{{{CT:0}}e^{{{CT:2}}{{CT:1}}}}{{CT:2}} = {{CT:3}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — The limits of integration</b><br>At the lower limit the antiderivative is evaluated as a limit as the variable tends to <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(-\\infty\\)</span> (the exponential tends to 0 faster than any power grows). Hence<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\int^0_{-\\infty}{{CT:0}} {{CT:1}} e^{{{CT:2}}{{CT:1}}}d{{CT:1}} = \\left[{{CT:3}}\\right]^0_{-\\infty} = {{CT:4}}\\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "integrate", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 2, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "diffanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">It looks like you may have differentiated instead!</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["J", "Jindefinite", "correctanswer", "diffJindefinite", "diffanswer", "f", "lowerJ", "n1", "n2", "upperJ", "v1"], "nvariants": 12}